  "description": "RETFOL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C45 H100 Lu4 O20. From the CIF bond table, Lu1 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu2 (Lu) has 6 O neighbors; Lu3 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors; Lu4 (Lu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.253-4.199 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.70-167.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Lu4(μ4-O)(μ3-OH)(OCMe2CH2OMe)9. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
